# Currency Converter: "Whenever YOU discard a card" - Bot1's own Wheel of Fortune makes both players discard their hands at
# once, and only Bot1's three discards are offered to its Converter, not the seven of Bot2. Bot1 accepts three times; if
# Bot2's cards were offered too, they would be offered first (Bot1's triggers go on the stack first, Bot2's resolve
# before them) and take the accepts. Bot1 casts the Wheel with a Black Lotus.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Currency Converter
Black Lotus
Wheel of Fortune
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Swamp
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Currency Converter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Wheel of Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Exile.Count = 3
Exile = Lightning Bolt; Forest; Swamp
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 7
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
